{"product_id":"between-two-wives-hussain-ali-lootah","title":"BETWEEN TWO WIVES Hussain Ali Lootah","description":"\u003cp\u003e‘There I was, leading a daily double life, different in most things and all aspects... I was no longer a dweller, for moving continuously became a commitment. My possessions were dispersed, my senses and feelings scattered. That day, I split myself in two before life did. I am not writing a story. I am telling the story of my life.’ Yusuf's life has been a series of events that would shape his destiny, his identity and the life of those he holds dearest to his heart. Between Two Wives tells his story—of life with his two wives, Aliyaa and Maria, and his inner conflict. Through a poetic and reflective narrative, the author navigates through Yusuf’s life as he struggles to come to terms with his decisions, his destiny and his identity as a ‘spouse-of-two’. In this book, Hussein Ali Lootah gives his readers a peek into a little-known reality of the Islamic polygamy, and explores the role of destiny in shaping one’s life. About the Author Hussain Ali Lootah was born in pre‑federation Dubai, in 1959. He is a highly reputed lawyer who obtained his bachelor’s degree in law from the United Arab Emirates University, Al Ain. He worked as a legal consultant with the UAE government for twelve years, before establishing Hussain Lootah and Associates in 1997, which has become one of the leading law firms in the country.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 0 x 0\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Hussain Ali Lootah\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781860634369\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 184\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45743086272665,"sku":"16RA-2-9781860634369","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68d176b8dbb13_BETWEEN_TWO_WIVES_Hussain_Ali_Lootah_Hussain_Ali_Lootah.jpg?v=1758708497","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/between-two-wives-hussain-ali-lootah","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}